`\n","\n","Find and fix the error.\n","\n","---\n","\n","### Q2\n","\n","```python\n","class Animal:\n","    def sound(self):\n","        print(\"Animal Sound\")\n","\n","class Dog(Animal):\n","    def sound(self)\n","        print(\"Bark\")\n","```\n","\n","Find and fix the error.\n","\n","---\n","\n","### Q3\n","\n","```python\n","class Book:\n","    def __init__(self,title):\n","        title = title\n","\n","b = Book(\"Python\")\n","print(b.title)\n","```\n","\n","Find and fix the error.\n","\n","---\n","\n","### Q4\n","\n","```python\n","class Calculator:\n","    def add(a,b):\n","        return a+b\n","\n","c = Calculator()\n","print(c.add(5,3))\n","```\n","\n","Find and fix the error.\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Section C: OOP Project (40 Marks)\n","\n","### Library Management System\n","\n","Create a class named **LibraryBook** with:\n","\n","#### Attributes\n","\n","* title\n","* author\n","* is_borrowed\n","\n","#### Methods\n","\n","1. `borrow_book()`\n","\n","   * Marks book as borrowed.\n","\n","2. `return_book()`\n","\n","   * Marks book as returned.\n","\n","3. `display_status()`\n","\n","   * Displays book details and status.\n","\n","#### Sample Output\n","\n","```\n","Title: Python Basics\n","Author: John Smith\n","Status: Available\n","\n","Book Borrowed Successfully!\n","\n","Title: Python Basics\n","Author: John Smith\n","Status: Borrowed\n","\n","Book Returned Successfully!\n","\n","Title: Python Basics\n","Author: John Smith\n","Status: Available\n","\n","\n","\n"],"metadata":{"id":"cNsD5PLLwCGb"}}]}